WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.150
Welcome to Appraisal scope and sampling. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Know why organizational boundaries and project sampling matter..

2
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:22.530
Consider this scenario. A company selects only its best-performing pilot and describes the result as company-wide. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:33.310
Start with two steps: Define organizational boundaries. Then Identify work and applicable practices. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:43.060
Continue with Plan a representative sample. Then Disclose limitations and context. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:54.320
Stronger evidence looks like this: Evidence of actual implementation. Weaker evidence would be: An unverified claim. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:00:54.320 --> 00:01:08.570
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
